SRE Best Practice

Combine the deployment wait script, endpoint invocation test, latency benchmark, and CloudWatch validation into a single CI/CD post-deployment stage. The deployment should automatically fail if:

Endpoint status ≠ InService
Any invocation test fails
CloudWatch contains critical errors
5XX errors are detected
P95 latency exceeds your SLA threshold

This gives you an end-to-end automated SageMaker deployment verification pipeline.


